---
import type { Locale } from '../data/i18n';
import { memeSource, ruleRows, seotdaMemes } from '../data/seotda';
import '../styles/member-seotda.css';
const { locale } = Astro.props as { locale: Locale };
const ko = locale === 'ko';
---
<dialog id="member-seotda" class="seotda" aria-labelledby="seotda-title" data-nosnippet>
  <header class="seotda-header"><div><span>Axii’s table</span><h2 id="seotda-title">{ko ? 'Axii와 섯다' : 'Seotda with Axii'}</h2></div><div class="seotda-header-actions"><button type="button" data-seotda-sound aria-pressed="true" aria-label={ko ? '효과음 끄기' : 'Mute sound effects'}><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 9h4l5-4v14l-5-4H4zM17 8a6 6 0 0 1 0 8M20 5a10 10 0 0 1 0 14" /></svg></button><button type="button" data-seotda-close aria-label={ko ? '섯다 닫기' : 'Close Seotda'}>×</button></div></header>
  <nav class="seotda-modes" aria-label={ko ? '게임 모드와 도움말' : 'Modes and help'}><button type="button" data-seotda-mode="story" aria-pressed="false">{ko ? '한 판 앉기' : 'Take a seat'}</button><button type="button" data-seotda-mode="free" aria-pressed="false">{ko ? '자유 섯다' : 'Free play'}</button><button type="button" data-seotda-help hidden aria-controls="seotda-beginner">{ko ? '튜토리얼' : 'Tutorial'}</button><button type="button" data-seotda-notes aria-controls="seotda-notes">{ko ? '더 보기' : 'More'}</button></nav>
  <div class="seotda-score" data-seotda-score></div>
  <div class="seotda-body">
    <section class="seotda-cinema" aria-label={ko ? '이번 장면' : 'Current scene'}>
      <figure class="seotda-meme" data-seotda-meme><button type="button" class="seotda-scene-photo" data-seotda-enlarge aria-label={ko ? '영화 장면 크게 보기' : 'Enlarge film scene'}><img data-seotda-image alt="" width="640" height="360" hidden /></button><p data-seotda-image-status role="status" hidden></p><button type="button" data-seotda-image-retry hidden>{ko ? '사진 다시 불러오기' : 'Retry photo'}</button><figcaption data-seotda-caption></figcaption></figure>
      <div class="seotda-dialogue" tabindex="-1" data-seotda-dialogue role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><h3 data-seotda-scene-title></h3><p data-seotda-line></p></div>
    </section>
    <section class="seotda-table" aria-label={ko ? '화투판' : 'Card table'} tabindex="-1" data-seotda-table></section>
  </div>
  <section class="seotda-cut" data-seotda-cut hidden aria-labelledby="seotda-cut-title">
    <div class="seotda-cut-stage">
      <div class="seotda-cut-visual"><img data-seotda-cut-photo width="1000" height="667" alt="" hidden /><img data-seotda-cut-card width="103" height="168" alt="" hidden /><p class="seotda-cut-error">{ko ? '이미지를 못 불러왔어요. 판으로 돌아가서 확인할 수 있어요.' : 'Image unavailable. You can still return to the table.'}</p></div>
      <div class="seotda-cut-copy" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><p data-seotda-cut-speaker></p><h3 id="seotda-cut-title" data-seotda-cut-title></h3><p data-seotda-cut-line></p></div>
    </div>
    <button type="button" data-seotda-cut-next></button>
  </section>
  <aside id="seotda-notes" class="seotda-notes" hidden aria-labelledby="seotda-notes-title">
    <header><h3 id="seotda-notes-title">{ko ? '테이블 노트' : 'Table notes'}</h3><button type="button" data-seotda-notes-close>{ko ? '← 게임으로' : '← Back to game'}</button></header>
    <div class="seotda-notebooks">
      <p class="seotda-save" data-seotda-save></p>
      <details id="seotda-beginner" class="seotda-beginner" hidden><summary>{ko ? '그림으로 배우는 섯다' : 'Learn with the cards'}</summary>
        <div class="seotda-guide" data-seotda-guide>
          <div class="seotda-guide-top"><span data-guide-progress></span><button type="button" data-seotda-skip-tutorial>{ko ? '건너뛰기' : 'Skip tutorial'}</button></div>
          <div class="seotda-guide-content" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label={ko ? '이번 단계 설명' : 'Current lesson'}>
            <div class="seotda-guide-copy"><h3 tabindex="-1" data-guide-title></h3><p data-guide-description></p></div>
            <div class="seotda-guide-visual" data-guide-visual></div>
            <p class="seotda-guide-feedback" data-seotda-practice-result role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          </div>
          <nav class="seotda-guide-nav" aria-label={ko ? '튜토리얼 단계' : 'Tutorial steps'}><button type="button" data-guide-prev>{ko ? '← 이전' : '← Back'}</button><button type="button" data-guide-next></button></nav>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details data-seotda-rules hidden><summary>{ko ? '이 판의 규칙과 족보' : 'Table rules & hand ranks'}</summary><p>{ko ? '게임용 칩으로만 하는 1:1 섯다예요. 자유 대국은 각자 1,000칩으로 5판을 진행해요. 한 명의 칩이 떨어져도 끝납니다. 기본 참가비는 20칩. 상대가 먼저 베팅하고, 내 패 두 장을 확인한 뒤 한 번 응수해요.' : 'Heads-up Seotda with play chips. Start with 1,000 each and play 5 rounds, or until one stack is empty. The ante is 20. The opponent opens, then you check both of your cards and respond.'}</p><p>{ko ? '하프는 콜한 뒤 판돈의 절반을 추가하고, 더블은 상대의 총 베팅만큼 더 올려요. 올인은 서로 받을 수 있는 칩까지만 걸어요. 같은 족보는 반씩 나누고, 구사는 판돈을 넘겨 다시 칩니다. 특수패 조건이 맞지 않으면 원래 끗수로 비교해요.' : 'Half adds half the pot after calling. Double raises by the opponent’s total commitment. All-in is capped at the smaller effective stack. Ties split the pot; Gusa carries it into a redeal. Special hands revert to their point value when their condition is not met.'}</p><p>{ko ? '한 판 앉기와 자유게임의 칩은 따로 저장해요. 자유게임에서는 언제든 튜토리얼을 선택하거나 건너뛸 수 있어요.' : 'Take a seat and Free play keep separate chip balances. In Free play, the tutorial is always optional and skippable.'}</p><dl class="seotda-ranks">{ruleRows.map(([title, description]) => <div><dt>{title[locale]}</dt><dd>{description[locale]}</dd></div>)}</dl><p class="seotda-credit"><a href="https://poker.hangame.com/gameguide/lasudda/game_lasudda2_2.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{ko ? '참고: 한게임 족보 안내' : 'Reference: Hangame hand guide'}</a> · {ko ? '이 판에서는 일삼·일팔광땡을 동급으로 칩니다.' : 'This table treats 1–3 and 1–8 bright as equal.'}</p></details>
      <details data-seotda-gallery><summary>{ko ? '타짜 장면 앨범' : 'Tazza scene album'}</summary><div class="seotda-meme-grid">{Object.entries(seotdaMemes).map(([id, meme]) => <figure data-seotda-gallery-id={id}><img data-seotda-gallery-src={`/images/tazza/${id}.jpg`} width="320" height="180" loading="lazy" alt={meme.alt[locale]} /><figcaption>{meme.title[locale]}</figcaption></figure>)}</div><p class="seotda-credit">{ko ? '영화 〈타짜〉(2006) 장면을 활용한 팬 메이드 게임. 영화 이미지의 권리는 원권리자에게 있습니다.' : 'A fan-made game using scenes from Tazza (2006). Film images belong to their respective rights holders.'} <a href={memeSource} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{ko ? '스틸 사진 출처 · 씨네21' : 'Still source · Cine21'}</a></p></details>
      <p class="seotda-credit"><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:SVG_Hwatu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{ko ? '화투 그림' : 'Hwatu artwork'}</a>: Marcus Richert · Louie Mantia, Jr. · Spenĉjo. <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CC BY-SA 4.0</a> · {ko ? '원본 그대로 사용' : 'Used without modification'}. <a href="/images/hwatu/ATTRIBUTION.txt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{ko ? '전체 출처' : 'Full credits'}</a></p>
      <details data-seotda-history-panel><summary>{ko ? '이번 자유 대국 기록' : 'This match’s history'}</summary><ol data-seotda-history></ol></details>
    </div>
  </aside>
  <footer class="seotda-controls"><p data-seotda-action-hint></p><div data-seotda-actions></div></footer>
</dialog>
<script src="../scripts/member-seotda.ts"></script>
